      "content": "thanks. one more thing—we've had a couple of close calls recently where stacks that looked perfectly fine just seemed to... shift or lean unexpectedly for no reason, almost like something bumped them. is there anything else besides just poor weight distribution that could cause that kind of sudden instability in a high-density setup?",
